          %h2#References References
          %p The original:
          %ul
            %li#Wigner31
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eugene+P.+Wigner"} Eugene P. Wigner
              §20 (appndx) of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Gruppentheorie und ihre Anwendung auf die Quantenmechanik der Atomspektren
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-663-02555-9"} doi:10.1007/978-3-663-02555-9
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://digbib.ubka.uni-karlsruhe.de/volltexte/wasbleibt/33355459/33355459.pdf"} pdf
          %p and its English translation:
          %ul
            %li#Wigner1959
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eugene+P.+Wigner"}> Eugene P. Wigner
              , §20(app.) and §26 in:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Group theory: And its application to the quantum mechanics of atomic spectra
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.elsevier.com/books/group-theory/wigner/978-0-12-750550-3"} doi:978-0-12-750550-3
          %p The first full proof:
          %ul
            %li#Bargmann64
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Valentine+Bargmann"}> Valentine Bargmann
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Note on Wigner’s theorem on symmetry transformations
              %strong 5
              7 (1964) 862-868 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1063/1.1704188"}> doi:10.1063/1.1704188
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://materias.df.uba.ar/t2a2019c2/files/2012/07/Bergman-1964.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Bargmann-WignerTheorem.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            New proof using the
            = succeed ":" do
