          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Wikipedia,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wigner%27s_theorem#Statement"} Wigner’s theorem
            %li#Uhlmann2016
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Armin+Uhlmann"}> Armin Uhlmann
